{"id":"ba289179148c44b3","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness.md","title":"Recursive Syntax and Proof Verification in the Book","display":"thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness — Recursive Syntax and Proof Verification in the Book","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness"],"display":"thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness — Recursive Syntax and Proof Verification in the Book","source":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36；第 IV 章 pp. 53–54，Exercises 4–7（PDF 50–53、70–71）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]]","[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","[[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness — Recursive Syntax and Proof Verification in the Book"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36；第 IV 章 pp. 53–54，Exercises 4–7（PDF 50–53、70–71）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1638d16173e7b51\" href=\"?note=f1638d16173e7b51\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound\">92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 分别取含指数/无指数版本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E\">\\(g_E\\)</span> 为原书编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pf}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Pf}_S\\)</span> 为原书有限证明码谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1\\)</span> 来自递归关系定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S^\\#,F_S^\\#,C_S^\\#,W_S^\\#\">\\(T_S^\\#,F_S^\\#,C_S^\\#,W_S^\\#\\)</span> 为以下定义的自然数集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}recursiveness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\},&amp;\nF_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\},\\\\\nC_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\},&amp;\nW_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(T_S^\\#)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(F_S^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(C_S^\\#)\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(W_S^\\#).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}recursiveness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\},&amp;\nF_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\},\\\\\nC_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\},&amp;\nW_S^\\#&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(T_S^\\#)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(F_S^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(C_S^\\#)\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(W_S^\\#).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项/公式的形成规则每次使新表达式码严格大于前提码。去掉重复表达式后，码为 x 的目标只需≤x 个中间表达式，且每个中间码≤x；因此原书形成序列的存在搜索可界于 π(x)。序列码和逐步形成关系按 #、函数名、括号、连接词、变量结构检查；原书附录 Exercise 3 的递归关系与递归函数界下存在闭包给出 recursive。闭句再检查有限公式树中是否有自由变量，仍是同一有限递归检查。</p>\n<p>证明码检查也有限：按 # 拆成确定的公式列表，对每行检查 L1–L7、N1–N11/归纳或 PA 对应限制；L5/L6 的“不出现”、L7 的单出现替换、N12 的新变量均为有限字符检查。非公理行只需在有限先前行中搜 MP 的两个前提或 Gen 的一个前提。每种模式的候选参数来自已给公式的有限语法树，不以无界枚举模式来判定成员。因此 Pf 可递归判定，其正负都可用原书 Σ₁ 关系表达。</p>\n<p>没有从 proof checking 递归推出 theorem checking 递归：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_S^\\#=\\{m:\\exists q\\,\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\}\">\\(P_S^\\#=\\{m:\\exists q\\,\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\}\\)</span> 的 q 没有统一可计算的结论搜索界。这里是原书递归论背景下的数学证明重构，未声称提供了可执行 PE/PA 编译器或机器核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound","status":"resolved","id":"f1638d16173e7b51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1","display":false},{"tex":"T_S^\\#,F_S^\\#,C_S^\\#,W_S^\\#","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}recursiveness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\},&\nF_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\},\\\\\nC_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\},&\nW_S^\\#&\\coloneqq\\{q:\\operatorname{Pf}_S(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(T_S^\\#)&\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(F_S^\\#)\n\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(C_S^\\#)\\land\\mathrm{RecRel}_E^1(W_S^\\#).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P_S^\\#=\\{m:\\exists q\\,\\operatorname{Prf}_S(q,m)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2727,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 recursive 定义和有限搜索界：[[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]] → [[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]。证明码检查递归不意味着定理码成员关系可判定。"},{"id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]"}],"outgoing":["f1638d16173e7b51","7a63648901cbcd33","cc77d3ecb4f82cf1"]}